Recorded responses for the source recipes' tests.

Each file is a response body shaped as the tool's published API
documentation shows it: Microsoft Graph v1.0, the GitHub REST API (version
2022-11-28), the Google Admin SDK Directory API v1 and the Okta Management
API. No live tenant, organisation or domain was read to make them; the
accounts, identifiers and names are made up, and every address is under the
reserved example domains. They hold fields the recipes do not read as well
as those they do, so the tests show that only the declared fields are kept.
